    'role' => $c ? wb_site_role($c['user'], (int)$s['id']) : null, 'menu' => $c ? wb_menu_for($c['user'], (int)$s['id']) : null, 'stats' => wb_site_stats((int)$s['id']));
}
function wb_site_alerts($s) { $a = array(); if (empty($s['public_url'])) { $a[] = array('level' => 'warn', 'text' => '공개 홈페이지 주소가 없습니다.'); } if (empty($s['last_published_at'])) { $a[] = array('level' => 'info', 'text' => '아직 게시하지 않았습니다. 상단 [게시하기]를 눌러 공개 홈페이지에 반영하세요.'); } $seo = wb_get("SELECT description FROM seo WHERE site_id = ? AND scope = 'site'", array((int)$s['id'])); if (!$seo || empty($seo['description'])) { $a[] = array('level' => 'info', 'text' => 'SEO 설명이 비어 있습니다.'); } return $a; }
function wb_system_status($c) { $up = 0; foreach (wb_walk_files(WB_WEB_ROOT . '/assets/uploads') as $f) { $up += $f['size']; } $bk = is_dir(WB_DATA_DIR . '/backups') ? count(glob(WB_DATA_DIR . '/backups/backup-*.php')) : 0; $lf = WB_DATA_DIR . '/logs/error-' . wb_today() . '.log.php'; $drv = wb_db_driver(); $dbBytes = 0; if ($drv === 'sqlite') { foreach (array('', '-wal', '-shm') as $sfx) { $f = WB_DATA_DIR . '/webbuilder.sqlite' . $sfx; if (is_file($f)) { $dbBytes += (int)@filesize($f); } } } else { try { $dbBytes = wb_int(wb_val('SELECT COALESCE(SUM(data_length + index_length), 0) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE table_schema = DATABASE()')); } catch (Exception $e) { $dbBytes = 0; } }
  $bkFiles = is_dir(WB_DATA_DIR . '/backups') ? glob(WB_DATA_DIR . '/backups/backup-*.php') : array(); $lastBk = ''; foreach ((array)$bkFiles as $bf) { $t = @filemtime($bf); if ($t && $t > ($lastBk === '' ? 0 : strtotime($lastBk))) { $lastBk = date('Y-m-d H:i:s', $t); } }
  $lastPub = wb_get("SELECT version_no, created_at FROM publish_snapshots WHERE status IS NULL OR status IN ('published', 'local-only') ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1");
  return array('dataDir' => str_replace(str_replace('\\', '/', WB_WEB_ROOT) . '/', '', str_replace('\\', '/', WB_DATA_DIR)), 'db_bytes' => $dbBytes, 'db' => $drv, 'db_label' => $drv === 'sqlite' ? 'SQLite (파일 DB)' : 'MySQL / MariaDB', 'last_backup' => $lastBk, 'last_publish' => $lastPub ? array('version' => (int)$lastPub['version_no'], 'at' => $lastPub['created_at']) : null, 'uploads_bytes' => $up, 'backups' => $bk, 'node' => 'PHP ' . PHP_VERSION, 'php' => PHP_VERSION, 'uptime' => 0, 'baseUrl' => $c['baseUrl'], 'publicFromConfig' => true, 'platform' => 'php', 'errors_today' => is_file($lf) ? count(array_filter(file($lf), function ($l) { return strpos($l, '[') === 0; })) : 0); }
function wb_system_settings() { $o = array('backupKeep' => 14, 'autoBackup' => true, 'retentionDays' => 365, 'analyticsKeepDays' => 400); foreach (wb_all('SELECT `key`, `value` FROM system_settings') as $r) { $o[$r['key']] = wb_json_safe($r['value'], $r['value']); } return $o; }

/* ================= 설정 마법사 · 데이터 가져오기 ================= */
wb_route('GET', '/setup/status', function ($c) { return array('needsSetup' => !wb_int(wb_val('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users')), 'hasSites' => (bool)wb_int(wb_val('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sites')), 'templates' => wb_template_list(), 'version' => WB_VERSION, 'baseUrl' => $c['baseUrl'], 'platform' => 'php', 'importAvailable' => is_file(WB_DATA_DIR . '/import.php')); }, array('open' => true));
function wb_import_data($c, $uid) {
  $file = WB_DATA_DIR . '/import.php'; if (!is_file($file)) { return null; }
  $raw = file_get_contents($file); if (strpos($raw, '<?php') === 0) { $p = strpos($raw, "\n"); $raw = $p === false ? '' : substr($raw, $p + 1); }
  $d = json_decode($raw, true); if (!is_array($d) || empty($d['tables'])) { throw new WbHttpError(422, '가져올 데이터 파일(import.php)의 형식이 올바르지 않습니다.'); }
  $order = array('advertisers', 'sites', 'settings', 'menus', 'menu_items', 'section_types', 'pages', 'page_versions', 'forms', 'form_fields', 'media_folders', 'media', 'popups', 'seo', 'publish_snapshots', 'system_settings'); $report = array();
  $schema = wb_schema();
  wb_tx(function () use ($d, $order, $schema, $uid, &$report) {
    foreach ($order as $table) {
      if (empty($d['tables'][$table]) || !is_array($d['tables'][$table])) { continue; } $cols = array(); foreach ($schema[$table] as $col) { if ($col[0][0] !== '_') { $cols[$col[0]] = substr($col[1], 0, 1); } } $n = 0;
      foreach ($d['tables'][$table] as $row) { $ins = array(); foreach ($row as $k => $v) { if (isset($cols[$k])) { if ($v === '' && in_array($cols[$k], array('I', 'R', 'D'), true)) { $v = null; } $ins[$k] = $v; } } if ($table === 'sites') { $dj = wb_arr(isset($ins['deploy_json']) ? $ins['deploy_json'] : null); $dj['mode'] = 'server'; unset($dj['host'], $dj['user'], $dj['pass'], $dj['passiveHost']); $ins['deploy_json'] = wb_enc($dj); $ins['created_by'] = $uid; } if ($table === 'page_versions' || $table === 'pages' || $table === 'popups' || $table === 'forms' || $table === 'settings' || $table === 'media') { foreach (array('created_by', 'updated_by', 'uploaded_by') as $k) { if (isset($ins[$k])) { $ins[$k] = null; } } } wb_insert($table, $ins); $n++; }
      $report[$table] = $n;
    }
  });
  @rename($file, WB_DATA_DIR . '/import.done-' . date('Ymd-His') . '.php');
  return $report;
}
/* 처음 설정의 현장 정보(현장명 · 대표번호 · 이메일 · 주소 · 상담시간 · 공개 주소)를 사이트 설정에도 넣음 → 홈페이지 · 문자에 바로 사용 */
function wb_setup_site_info($siteId, $in, $uid) { try { $g = wb_get_setting($siteId, 'site'); if (!is_object($g)) { $g = new stdClass(); } if (!isset($g->site) || !is_object($g->site)) { $g->site = new stdClass(); } $map = array('name' => 'name', 'tel' => 'tel', 'email' => 'email', 'address' => 'address', 'consultHours' => 'consultHours', 'public_url' => 'url'); foreach ($map as $k => $to) { if (isset($in[$k]) && trim((string)$in[$k]) !== '') { $g->site->$to = wb_str($in[$k], 200); } } wb_put_setting($siteId, 'site', $g, $uid); } catch (Exception $e) { wb_log_error('setup site info: ' . $e->getMessage()); } }
wb_route('POST', '/setup', function ($c) {
  if (wb_int(wb_val('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users'))) { throw new WbHttpError(403, '이미 설정이 완료되었습니다. 로그인해 주세요.'); }
  $b = $c['body']; $err = wb_valid_password(isset($b['password']) ? $b['password'] : ''); if ($err) { throw new WbHttpError(422, $err); }
  $loginId = wb_lower(trim(wb_str(isset($b['loginId']) ? $b['loginId'] : ''))); if (!preg_match('/^[a-z0-9_.@\-]{3,40}$/', $loginId)) { throw new WbHttpError(422, '로그인 아이디는 영문 · 숫자 3~40자로 입력해 주세요.'); }
  $email = wb_lower(trim(wb_str(isset($b['email']) ? $b['email'] : ''))); if ($email === '') { $email = strpos($loginId, '@') !== false ? $loginId : $loginId . '@local'; }
  $uid = wb_insert('users', array('login_id' => $loginId, 'email' => $email, 'password_hash' => wb_hash_password($b['password']), 'name' => wb_str(isset($b['name']) ? $b['name'] : '', 60) ?: '최고관리자', 'role' => 'super', 'status' => 'active', 'phone' => wb_str(isset($b['phone']) ? $b['phone'] : '', 30), 'company' => wb_str(isset($b['company']) ? $b['company'] : '', 80), 'tel' => wb_str(isset($b['tel']) ? $b['tel'] : '', 30), 'created_at' => wb_now(), 'updated_at' => wb_now()));
  $c['user'] = wb_get('SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?', array($uid));
  $imported = null; $site = null;
  if (is_file(WB_DATA_DIR . '/import.php') && !wb_int(wb_val('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM sites'))) { $imported = wb_import_data($c, $uid); $site = wb_get("SELECT * FROM sites WHERE status <> 'deleted' ORDER BY id LIMIT 1"); }
  elseif (!empty($b['site']) && is_array($b['site']) && !empty($b['site']['name'])) { $site = wb_create_site_from_input($c, $b['site'], $uid); wb_setup_site_info((int)$site['id'], $b['site'], $uid); }
  wb_log($c, $site ? (int)$site['id'] : null, 'setup', 'system', null, '초기 설정 완료 · 최고관리자 ' . $loginId . ($imported ? ' · 기존 데이터 가져오기 ' . wb_enc($imported) : ''));
  $token = wb_create_session($uid, $c);
  return array('token' => $token, 'user' => wb_public_user($c['user']), 'site' => $site ? wb_site_out($site, $c) : null, 'imported' => $imported);
}, array('open' => true));

